{"4910930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gran Velocita - Real Driving", "steam_appid": 4910930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.poster.avif?t=1784818391\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.webm?t=1784818391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.mp4?t=1784818391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seat is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner, every braking point, every setup choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gran Velocita - Real Driving</strong> is a racing simulator focused on authentic driving. Learn how your car behaves, fine-tune every component, and compete in online races where precision and consistency decide who reaches the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏎️ Drive Different Racing Classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race a wide variety of cars, including Street, GT4, GT3, LMP, Formula 4, and Formula 1. Every class has its own handling, performance, and driving characteristics that you'll need to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Build the Perfect Setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust suspension, camber, dampers, tire pressure, gear ratios, aerodynamics, and more. Find the right balance for every track and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 Feel Real Vehicle Physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire wear, temperature, pressure, suspension movement, aerodynamic balance, brake fade, and engine wear all affect your lap times. Push too hard, and your car will let you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Race Real Players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in ranked online multiplayer with a combined Skill and Safety Rating system. Win races, improve your rating, and prove you can be both fast and clean on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Improve Every Lap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use telemetry, watch replays, and plan your race strategy to keep improving. Analyze your driving, fix mistakes, and squeeze every bit of performance from your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gran Velocita - Real Driving brings the depth of a true racing simulator to your phone, giving you everything you need to learn, compete, and become a faster driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.poster.avif?t=1784818391\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.webm?t=1784818391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/extras/90279ac33280e5867d90a2f1a71de275.mp4?t=1784818391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seat is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner, every braking point, every setup choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gran Velocita - Real Driving</strong> is a racing simulator focused on authentic driving. Learn how your car behaves, fine-tune every component, and compete in online races where precision and consistency decide who reaches the finish line first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏎️ Drive Different Racing Classes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race a wide variety of cars, including Street, GT4, GT3, LMP, Formula 4, and Formula 1. Every class has its own handling, performance, and driving characteristics that you'll need to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Build the Perfect Setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust suspension, camber, dampers, tire pressure, gear ratios, aerodynamics, and more. Find the right balance for every track and driving style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛞 Feel Real Vehicle Physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tire wear, temperature, pressure, suspension movement, aerodynamic balance, brake fade, and engine wear all affect your lap times. Push too hard, and your car will let you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 Race Real Players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in ranked online multiplayer with a combined Skill and Safety Rating system. Win races, improve your rating, and prove you can be both fast and clean on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Improve Every Lap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use telemetry, watch replays, and plan your race strategy to keep improving. Analyze your driving, fix mistakes, and squeeze every bit of performance from your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gran Velocita - Real Driving brings the depth of a true racing simulator to your phone, giving you everything you need to learn, compete, and become a faster driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Experience true sim racing with realistic tire and aerodynamic physics. 🏎️🔥 Fully customize your car setup, compete across multiple racing classes from GT to Formula, and climb the ranked online multiplayer ladder where both speed and clean driving determine your success. 🏁⚙️", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4910930/0360277004307add602361b6a73b221bf9a5cb60/header.jpg?t=1784818391", "capsule_image": "https://share